{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_tracker", "label": "Tracker (self-hosted life-management PWA)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:1-7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single-user, self-hosted PWA keyed off \"today\": habits, DSA practice, learning roadmaps, goals, manual health log. Runs entirely on the user's own machine against their own Postgres \u2014 no accounts, no cloud, no third-party sync."}, {"id": "readme_next15_webpack_pwa", "label": "Next 15 over Next 16 (webpack keeps the PWA)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:20-22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "@ducanh2912/next-pwa is a webpack plugin. Next 16 builds with Turbopack by default, which would skip the plugin silently and ship no service worker. Next 15 keeps webpack as the default build path."}, {"id": "readme_app_timezone", "label": "APP_TIMEZONE (server-side definition of \"today\")", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:35-37", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An IANA zone decides what \"today\" means for every habit, health and DSA log. Resolved server-side and passed down \u2014 never read from the browser clock, or an 11pm check-off lands on the wrong day."}, {"id": "readme_app_password", "label": "APP_PASSWORD (single-password auth)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:69-72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "There is no users table. One password lives in APP_PASSWORD; the login page checks it and sets a signed httpOnly session cookie."}, {"id": "readme_session_secret", "label": "SESSION_SECRET (HS256 session signing)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:39-43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "32 random bytes hex; signs the session cookie via jose HS256 with a 30-day expiry."}, {"id": "readme_cookie_secure_default_false", "label": "COOKIE_SECURE defaults to false", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:76-78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The app is opened over plain http:// on a LAN from a phone, and a Secure cookie would never be sent. Set true only once the app sits behind HTTPS."}, {"id": "readme_constant_time_password_check", "label": "Constant-time password comparison", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:79-80", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "node:crypto.timingSafeEqual over SHA-256 digests of both sides, so buffer lengths always match and the comparison cannot leak length or prefix timing."}, {"id": "readme_middleware_session_gate", "label": "Middleware session gate (except /login and PWA files)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:70-72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "src/middleware.ts gates every route except /login and the PWA files \u2014 the service worker and manifest must stay public or installing the app breaks."}, {"id": "readme_explicit_migrations", "label": "Explicit SQL migrations, never auto-pushed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:99-111", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Migrations are checked-in files. db:generate only diffs schema.ts against the migration journal and never touches a live database, so it is safe to run with nothing else up."}, {"id": "readme_idempotent_roadmap_seed", "label": "Idempotent roadmap seed preserves progress", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:142-145", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The seed upserts on (roadmap, parent, title) and deliberately does not touch status, so re-running it after editing a JSON file refreshes structure without wiping progress. In-app roadmap/topic creation writes to the same tables."}, {"id": "readme_db_port_5433", "label": "Postgres published on 5433, not 5432", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:149-152", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The machine already runs a native PostgreSQL service on 5432; colliding there makes host-side tools connect to the wrong server and fail with a confusing auth error. DATABASE_URL points at localhost:5433; DB_PORT overrides it."}, {"id": "readme_counted_kinds_rule", "label": "Only leaf core/recommended topics count", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:197-202", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "alternative is pick-one (you learn React, not also Vue and Angular), so counting alternatives would cap the bar below 100% forever; optional is excluded for the same reason. A zero denominator yields null, rendered \"\u2014\", which is a different statement from 0%."}, {"id": "readme_goal_progress_precedence", "label": "Goal progress precedence: roadmap > milestones > manual", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:203-206", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A roadmap-linked goal uses its roadmap's %; otherwise milestones win whenever any exist; otherwise the manual slider. Reaching 100% never auto-completes a goal \u2014 status is always an explicit choice."}, {"id": "readme_streak_unchecked_today", "label": "Unchecked today does not break a streak", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:207-210", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The day isn't over, so counting starts from yesterday and only a past missed day ends the run. Weekly habits get no multi-week streak in Phase 1 \u2014 they report \"3 / 5 this week\" over a Monday-start week."}, {"id": "readme_optimistic_client_recompute", "label": "Pure DB-free progress modules re-run client-side", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:212-214", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All three progress modules take dates as YYYY-MM-DD strings and are re-run client-side for optimistic updates, so a mid-flight tap can never display a number the server would disagree with."}, {"id": "readme_single_roadmap_percent_path", "label": "roadmap-queries is the single DB path for a roadmap %", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:216-218", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Roadmaps page and any goal tracking that roadmap both read through src/lib/roadmap-queries.ts, so the two screens cannot disagree."}, {"id": "readme_roadmap_delete_set_null", "label": "Deleting a roadmap does not delete goals", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:220-221", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "goals.roadmap_id is ON DELETE SET NULL; such a goal falls back to manual progress and says so."}, {"id": "readme_habits_no_bottom_nav", "label": "Habits has no bottom-nav tab", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:235-237", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The bar deliberately stays at five (Today \u00b7 Roadmaps \u00b7 DSA \u00b7 Goals \u00b7 Health). /habits is the management screen; HabitCheckList is a self-contained component the Today dashboard will embed next pass."}, {"id": "readme_phase1_scope", "label": "Phase 1 scope and deferred phases", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:229-244", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built: Roadmaps, Goals, Habits, DSA, login, app shell. Still to come in Phase 1: Today dashboard, Health, PWA manifest/service worker. Later phases the schema already leaves room for: task list, money/spending, projects, learning calendar, analytics, Open Food Facts food database."}, {"id": "readme_e2e_against_live_containers", "label": "E2E suite runs against the live containers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:162-175", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Playwright runs against the already-running containers, not a separate dev server. The suite creates and deletes its own data and restores any seeded topic it changes, so it is safe to re-run against the real database."}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_counted_kinds_rule", "target": "src_lib_roadmap_progress_counted_kinds", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:197-202", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_counted_kinds_rule", "target": "src_lib_roadmap_progress_iscounted", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:197-202", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_counted_kinds_rule", "target": "src_lib_roadmap_progress_leavesunder", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:197-199", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_counted_kinds_rule", "target": "src_lib_roadmap_progress_formatpercent", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:200-202", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_goal_progress_precedence", "target": "src_lib_goal_progress_computegoalprogress", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:203-206", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_goal_progress_precedence", "target": "src_lib_goal_progress_isreadytocomplete", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:205-206", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_streak_unchecked_today", "target": "src_lib_habit_streak_currentstreak", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:207-210", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_streak_unchecked_today", "target": "src_lib_habit_streak_weeklyprogress", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:209-210", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_single_roadmap_percent_path", "target": "src_lib_roadmap_queries_getroadmapprogress", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:216-218", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_single_roadmap_percent_path", "target": "src_lib_roadmap_queries_getroadmapprogressmap", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:216-218", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_optimisti